{"challenge_axes":[],"difficulty":3,"generation_seed":20261009,"generator_version":"1.0.0","oracle_version":"independent-1.0.0","producer_agent_id":"/root/relational_critic_producer","producer_role":"producer","record_hash":"54a93845ff6874c62e41c0b88106b39cff416e4deca472ab6109c6975c7570b2","rendered_input":"Executable task contract:\nJSON scalar values in this task are null, boolean, integer (excluding boolean), or string. No floating point or coercion is used. Scalar equality is type-sensitive. Malformed tasks are outside the valid-task domain.\nInput: `objects` and `places` are nonempty lists of distinct strings. `initial_locations` maps every object to an existing place. `agents` lists `{agent_id:string,initial_beliefs:{object:place_or_null},object_priority:[distinct_existing_objects]}` with distinct agent IDs; initial_beliefs contains every object, null denotes unknown, and explicitly supplied non-null beliefs may already be false. `events` is an ordered list of `{object:existing_object,to:existing_place,observed_by:[distinct_existing_agent_ids]}`. Every event updates the actual location of its object. Exactly the listed observing agents update that object's belief to to; all other beliefs retain their previous value. Process events in order. For each agent, false_belief_objects lists objects with a known belief differing from actual final location; unknown_objects lists objects with null belief. Sort both lists lexicographically. Its stated policy chooses the first object in object_priority with non-null final belief, returning `{type:\"search\",object:object_name,place:believed_place}`; if none exists return `{type:\"abstain\"}`. Return exactly `{actual_locations:final_location_map,agents:[{agent_id,beliefs:final_belief_map,false_belief_objects:[object_names],unknown_objects:[object_names],action:policy_action}]}` with agent rows in input order. Behavior follows these explicit observations and policies. No intentions, emotions, hidden psychological traits, or second-order beliefs are inferred.\nTask JSON:\n{\"kind\":\"agent_history\",\"objects\":[\"book\",\"key\"],\"places\":[\"desk\",\"drawer\",\"shelf\"],\"initial_locations\":{\"book\":\"desk\",\"key\":\"drawer\"},\"agents\":[{\"agent_id\":\"Ada\",\"initial_beliefs\":{\"book\":\"desk\",\"key\":\"drawer\"},\"object_priority\":[\"book\",\"key\"]},{\"agent_id\":\"Bex\",\"initial_beliefs\":{\"book\":null,\"key\":\"shelf\"},\"object_priority\":[]}],\"events\":[{\"object\":\"book\",\"to\":\"drawer\",\"observed_by\":[\"Ada\",\"Bex\"]},{\"object\":\"key\",\"to\":\"shelf\",\"observed_by\":[\"Ada\",\"Bex\"]},{\"object\":\"book\",\"to\":\"desk\",\"observed_by\":[\"Ada\",\"Bex\"]}]}","renderer":"forward","review_receipt_ids":["expert-ROM-001-extended-pilot-v2-p0000-base-forward-79a17e25274a","adv-extended-pilot-v2-d1a7a56443a92fee3911","adj-extended-pilot-v2-c7b9cacc50170ffdccf3"],"review_status":"ACCEPTED","reviewed_candidate_hash":"79a17e25274a240e72797ef241e28c307b6e81e320b40e5ebe290068ffff0536","sample_id":"ROM-001-extended-pilot-v2-p0000-base-forward","scope_limitation":"Supplied first-order observation histories and declared search policies; no inferred psychology or second-order beliefs.","semantic_family_id":"ROM-001-extended-pilot-v2-p0000","semantic_parent_id":"ROM-001-extended-pilot-v2-p0000","semantic_task":{"agents":[{"agent_id":"Ada","initial_beliefs":{"book":"desk","key":"drawer"},"object_priority":["book","key"]},{"agent_id":"Bex","initial_beliefs":{"book":null,"key":"shelf"},"object_priority":[]}],"events":[{"object":"book","observed_by":["Ada","Bex"],"to":"drawer"},{"object":"key","observed_by":["Ada","Bex"],"to":"shelf"},{"object":"book","observed_by":["Ada","Bex"],"to":"desk"}],"initial_locations":{"book":"desk","key":"drawer"},"kind":"agent_history","objects":["book","key"],"places":["desk","drawer","shelf"]},"skill_tags":["finite_synthetic_proxy","agent_history","shared_observation"],"source_provenance":{"license":"repository-private-research","origin":"origi